<title>USA: Sioux Falls cattle not tested - USDA.</title>
<headline>Sioux Falls cattle not tested - USDA.</headline>
<dateline>SIOUX FALLS 1996-12-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Not enough any class slaughter cattle on hand to test trade. For the Week:</p>
<p>Slaughter steers and heifers $1.00-$2.00 lower. Slaughter cows $1.00 higher.  Bulls steady to $1.00 higher. Receipts this week near 2,450, including 1,303 feeder cattle, compared to 2,392 last week and 2,303 a year ago.</p>
</text>
